<title>RUSSIA: Russian M2 money rises to 339.4 trln rbls June 1.</title>
<headline>Russian M2 money rises to 339.4 trln rbls June 1.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's M2 money supply rose to 339.4 trillion roubles on June 1 from 328.4 trillion roubles on May 1, the central bank said on Friday.</p>
<p>The rate of growth in money supply was 15.0 percent between January 1 and June 1, it said in its latest bulletin. Consumer prices rose over the same period by 7.4 percent.</p>
